sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as Organisateur
  actor A as Administrateur
  participant F as Frontend
  participant G as Gateway
  participant E as Event Service
  participant DE as movent_events

  O->>F: Remplit le formulaire événement
  F->>G: POST /api/events (JWT ORGANIZER)
  G->>E: POST /api/events
  E->>E: jwt + role:ORGANIZER,ADMIN ; validation
  E->>DE: INSERT events (status=DRAFT, available=capacity)
  E-->>F: 201 DRAFT
  Note over O,A: invisible dans le catalogue public

  O->>F: « Soumettre »
  F->>E: POST /api/events/{id}/submit
  E->>DE: status DRAFT|REJECTED → PENDING, rejection_reason=NULL
  E-->>F: 200 PENDING

  A->>F: GET /api/admin/events?status=PENDING
  F->>E: GET /api/admin/events (JWT ADMIN)
  E->>DE: SELECT … WHERE status=PENDING
  E-->>A: liste des demandes

  alt Validation
    A->>F: « Valider »
    F->>E: POST /api/events/{id}/approve
    E->>DE: status=PENDING → APPROVED
    E-->>F: 200 APPROVED → visible au catalogue
  else Rejet
    A->>F: « Rejeter » + motif
    F->>E: POST /api/events/{id}/reject {reason}
    E->>DE: status=REJECTED, rejection_reason=motif
    E-->>F: 200 REJECTED
    O->>F: Voit le motif, corrige, resoumet
    F->>E: PUT /api/events/{id} puis POST …/submit
  end
